			"notes": "# 6.3.1\n## Notes:\n- Focused on config stability and debug improvements.\n## Changes:\n- Config values are now validated (invalid configs reset to safe defaults).\n- Invalid configs are dumped for debugging.\n- Debug overlay shows average visual speedometer creation time.\n- Config menu now uses a slider for image size (with proper bounds).\n## Fixes:\n- Prevents crashes and misbehavior from corrupted configs.\n- Fixed language strings for size errors (EN & SV).\n\nThe 1.21.4 version shuld work for 1.21.1 thru 1.21.4, and 1.21.8 shuld work for 1.21.5 to 1.21.8\n\nremember to fetch the proper version of\n- [Architectury](https://modrinth.com/mod/architectury-api/versions)\n- [Cloth Config API (Optional)](https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config/versions)\n- [Fabric API (Fabric Only)](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api/versions)\n- [Mod Menu (Optional, Fabric Only)](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu/versions)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/zaze06/Speedometer/compare/6.3.0...6.3.1"
		},
